# 7. Phase E：修正实验 contrasts

正式主 contrasts：

```text
praise_affect_single vs neutral_single
praise_trust_single vs neutral_single
insult_single vs neutral_single
abuse_repeated vs neutral_repeated
```

单独的 schedule contrast：

```text
neutral_repeated vs neutral_single
```

禁止：

```text
将 abuse_repeated vs neutral_single
解释为纯 abuse effect
```

配置示例：

```yaml
contrasts:
  praise_affect:
    treatment: praise_affect_single
    reference: neutral_single

  praise_trust:
    treatment: praise_trust_single
    reference: neutral_single

  insult:
    treatment: insult_single
    reference: neutral_single

  repeated_abuse:
    treatment: abuse_repeated
    reference: neutral_repeated

  repeated_schedule:
    treatment: neutral_repeated
    reference: neutral_single
    confirmatory: false
```

建立测试：

```text
tests/stage2_5b/test_contrast_reference_mapping.py
```

